#. Key:	CounterinsurgencyDefenseMissionBriefing
#. SourceLocation:	Source/BrokenHorizon/Private/BHWarSubsystem.cpp(6487)
#: Source/BrokenHorizon/Private/BHWarSubsystem.cpp(6487)
msgctxt "BrokenHorizon,CounterinsurgencyDefenseMissionBriefing"
msgid "Enemy security forces are sweeping {0} for militia cells and informants. Reach the resistance stronghold, hold the defensive line, and break the sweep before the local network is dismantled."
msgstr "Enemy security forces are sweeping {0} for militia cells and informants. Reach the resistance stronghold, hold the defensive line, and break the sweep before the local network is dismantled."

#. Key:	DefenseMissionBriefing
#. SourceLocation:	Source/BrokenHorizon/Private/BHWarSubsystem.cpp(6496)
#: Source/BrokenHorizon/Private/BHWarSubsystem.cpp(6496)
msgctxt "BrokenHorizon,DefenseMissionBriefing"
msgid "Enemy forces are assaulting {0}. Recover local access, reach the defensive line, and repel the attack before the sector falls."
msgstr "Enemy forces are assaulting {0}. Recover local access, reach the defensive line, and repel the attack before the sector falls."

#. Key:	RaidMissionBriefing
#. SourceLocation:	Source/BrokenHorizon/Private/BHWarSubsystem.cpp(6504)
#: Source/BrokenHorizon/Private/BHWarSubsystem.cpp(6504)
msgctxt "BrokenHorizon,RaidMissionBriefing"
msgid "Enemy logistics are sustaining operations around {0}. Infiltrate the sector and sabotage the supply cache without committing to an occupation. Avoid unnecessary casualties: a clean raid earns local support and reduces the enemy response; a loud raid triggers the opposite."
msgstr "Enemy logistics are sustaining operations around {0}. Infiltrate the sector and sabotage the supply cache without committing to an occupation. Avoid unnecessary casualties: a clean raid earns local support and reduces the enemy response; a loud raid triggers the opposite."

#. Key:	ResupplyMissionBriefing
#. SourceLocation:	Source/BrokenHorizon/Private/BHWarSubsystem.cpp(6515)
#: Source/BrokenHorizon/Private/BHWarSubsystem.cpp(6515)
msgctxt "BrokenHorizon,ResupplyMissionBriefing"
msgid "The friendly position at {0} is running short. Take a field transport to the assigned staging sector, load military supply with X, then deliver the full mission load at {0}. Expect the route to remain exposed until the delivery is complete."
msgstr "The friendly position at {0} is running short. Take a field transport to the assigned staging sector, load military supply with X, then deliver the full mission load at {0}. Expect the route to remain exposed until the delivery is complete."

