#: Source/BrokenHorizon/Private/BHWarSubsystem.cpp(6525)
msgctxt "BrokenHorizon,EscortMissionBriefing"
msgid "A friendly convoy bound for {0} is exposed on the route. Locate the marked convoy, suppress the ambush force, and keep the vehicle intact until it clears the local route."
msgstr "A friendly convoy bound for {0} is exposed on the route. Locate the marked convoy, suppress the ambush force, and keep the vehicle intact until it clears the local route."

#. Key:	RescueMissionBriefing
